{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q140466381","formula":"C₁₅H₂₆O₉","hill":"C15H26O9","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":26.0,"O":9.0},"names":{"en":"Glycerol tris(3-hydroxybutyrate)"},"descriptions":{"en":"Glyceryl-tris-3-hydroxybutyrate (3GHB), sold under brand names like Neuridan and TriKeto 3BHB, is a triglyceride and ketone ester and the glycerol triester of the short-chain fatty acid and ketone body β-hydroxybutyric acid (β-hydroxybutyrate; BHB; 3-hydroxybutyrate). It is slowly metabolized and converted into BHB in the body. Ketone esters like 3GHB can induce rapid, significant, and sustained ketosis with oral administration and are an alternative to the ketogenic diet and fasting for achieving ketosis."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":21470345,"mass":350.36,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(CC(=O)OCC(COC(=O)CC(C)O)OC(=O)CC(C)O)O","inchikey":"NHEUWFPWBFBDRF-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"2,3-bis(3-hydroxybutanoyloxy)propyl 3-hydroxybutanoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"21470345","atoms":50,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.427,"y":1.201,"z":-0.775,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.171,"y":1.814,"z":-0.683,"el":"O"},{"x":0.534,"y":-1.28,"z":-1.647,"el":"O"},{"x":4.041,"y":0.402,"z":1.202,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.737,"y":-0.893,"z":0.704,"el":"O"},{"x":0.317,"y":-4.179,"z":1.33,"el":"O"},{"x":1.253,"y":2.544,"z":1.093,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.102,"y":2.05,"z":1.611,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.062,"y":-2.267,"z":-0.307,"el":"O"},{"x":0.044,"y":0.858,"z":-0.66,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.786,"y":2.132,"z":-0.764,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.292,"y":-0.119,"z":-1.779,"el":"C"},{"x":3.373,"y":2.315,"z":-0.086,"el":"C"},{"x":4.2,"y":1.029,"z":-0.069,"el":"C"},{"x":1.903,"y":2.06,"z":0.176,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.18,"y":1.457,"z":0.486,"el":"C"},{"x":1.01,"y":-3.429,"z":-0.843,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.411,"y":0.067,"z":-0.108,"el":"C